<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="htmx-config" content='{"refreshOnHistoryMiss":true}'>
<title>Connect an application · Help desk</title>

<script src="/static/save-feedback.js?v=VERSION" defer></script><script src="/static/htmx.min.js?v=VERSION" defer></script><script src="/static/notifications.js?v=VERSION" defer></script><script src="/static/shell.js?v=VERSION" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
<div class="shell">
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-brand">
      <a class="brand-mark" href="/tickets" aria-label="tkt">T</a>
      <a class="brand-text" href="/tickets" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="brand-name">tkt</span><span class="brand-product">Help desk</span></a>
      <button class="sidebar-close" type="button" data-sidebar-close aria-label="Close menu">×</button>
    </div>
    <nav class="sidebar-nav" aria-label="Sections">
      <div class="sidebar-group">
        <span class="sidebar-group-label">Work</span>
        <a class="sidebar-link" href="/tickets" data-tip="Tickets">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1a2 2 0 0 0 0 4v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0 0-4V9z"/><path d="M13 7v10"/></svg>
          <span class="sidebar-label">Tickets</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-foot">
      <button class="sidebar-collapse" type="button" data-sidebar-collapse aria-pressed="false" data-tip="Expand sidebar" data-label-collapse="Collapse sidebar" data-label-expand="Expand sidebar" aria-keyshortcuts="[">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 7l-5 5 5 5"/><path d="M18 7l-5 5 5 5"/></svg>
        <span class="sidebar-label">Collapse sidebar</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sidebar-user">
        <button class="sidebar-user-button" type="button" data-user-menu-toggle aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="user-menu" data-tip="Ana Torres">
          <span class="sidebar-avatar" aria-hidden="true">AT</span>
          <span class="sidebar-label sidebar-user-text"><span class="sidebar-user-name">Ana Torres</span><span class="sidebar-user-role">Agent</span></span>
          <svg class="sidebar-user-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 14l6-6 6 6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="user-menu" id="user-menu" role="menu" aria-label="Ana Torres" hidden>
          <a class="user-menu-item" role="menuitem" href="/preferences">Preferences</a>
          <form class="user-menu-logout" method="post" action="/logout">
            <button class="user-menu-item" role="menuitem" type="submit">Log out</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div class="sidebar-scrim" data-sidebar-close hidden></div>
  <div class="shell-body">
    <header class="topbar">
      <button class="topbar-menu" type="button" data-sidebar-open aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="sidebar" aria-expanded="false">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/><path d="M4 17h16"/></svg>
      </button>
      <span class="topbar-section" aria-hidden="true">tkt</span>
      <div class="topbar-spacer"></div>
      <div class="topbar-notifications" id="notification-bell" hx-get="/notifications/count" hx-trigger="load, every 45s [document.visibilityState === 'visible'], notifications:changed from:body" hx-target="this" hx-swap="innerHTML"><a class="bell-link" id="notification-bell-link" href="/notifications" hx-get="/notifications" hx-target="#notification-panel-host" hx-swap="innerHTML" title="Notifications" aria-label="Notifications">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 9a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 5-2.5 6.5-2.5 6.5h17S18 14 18 9z"/><path d="M10.4 19.5a2 2 0 0 0 3.2 0"/></svg>
</a></div>
      <a class="btn primary topbar-new" href="/tickets/new">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
        <span class="topbar-new-label">New ticket</span>
      </a>
    </header>
    <main class="main" id="main-content">
<div id="save-feedback" class="save-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden data-feedback-message="" data-feedback-kind="">
  <span class="save-feedback-message"></span>
  <button class="save-feedback-dismiss" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss confirmation">Dismiss</button>
</div>

<div class="preferences-screen">
  <div class="command-header">
    <div>
      <h1 class="command-title">Allow Claude &lt;Code&gt; to act as you?</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="preferences-note">Signed in as Ana Torres. If you allow it, the application acts as you.</p>
  <div class="preferences-sections">
    <section class="preferences-section" aria-labelledby="oauth-consent-scopes">
      <div class="preferences-section-head">
        <h2 id="oauth-consent-scopes">What it can do</h2>
        <p>Anything your role cannot do is left out when you allow access.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="oauth-scopes">
        <li>See the categories and their forms <code>catalog:read</code></li>
        <li>Read and search the tickets you can see <code>tickets:read</code></li>
        <li>Create tickets and work on them as you <code>tickets:write</code></li>
        <li>Write public comments as you <code>comments:write</code></li>
        <li>Write internal comments as you <code>comments:internal</code></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="preferences-section" aria-labelledby="oauth-consent-return">
      <div class="preferences-section-head">
        <h2 id="oauth-consent-return">Return address</h2>
        <p>Your browser goes back here after you decide. Allow only an application you started connecting yourself.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="oauth-return"><strong>localhost:4567</strong></p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <form class="preferences-actions" method="post" action="/oauth/authorize">
    <input type="hidden" name="client_id" value="tktcl_0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef">
    <input type="hidden" name="redirect_uri" value="http://localhost:4567/callback">
    <input type="hidden" name="response_type" value="code">
    <input type="hidden" name="state" value="st-123">
    <input type="hidden" name="code_challenge" value="rUbMX9ACdr7Ugo6eKj_9HkLo1PBlI7HrZw5ZCoViIoY">
    <input type="hidden" name="code_challenge_method" value="S256">
    <input type="hidden" name="scope" value="catalog:read tickets:read tickets:write comments:write comments:internal">
    <input type="hidden" name="resource" value="https://tkt.example.test/mcp">
    <button class="btn primary" type="submit" name="decision" value="approve">Allow access</button>
    <button class="btn" type="submit" name="decision" value="deny">Deny</button>
  </form>
</div>
</main>
    <nav class="tabbar" aria-label="Sections">
      <a class="tabbar-item" href="/tickets">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1a2 2 0 0 0 0 4v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0 0-4V9z"/><path d="M13 7v10"/></svg>
        <span>Tickets</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tabbar-item" href="/notifications">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 9a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 5-2.5 6.5-2.5 6.5h17S18 14 18 9z"/><path d="M10.4 19.5a2 2 0 0 0 3.2 0"/></svg>
        <span>Notifications</span>
      </a>
      <button class="tabbar-item" type="button" data-sidebar-open aria-controls="sidebar" aria-expanded="false">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/><path d="M4 17h16"/></svg>
        <span>More</span>
      </button>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="notification-panel-host" id="notification-panel-host"></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
